The YouTube arm (`youtube_up`) of the 2026 market test covered 10 markets: CMH, CVG, DLH, GRB, MKE, MLI, MSN, RFD, RST and TOL. Those markets closed 3,741 deals in the window.

I counted Closed Won opportunities with a close date from 2026-02-02 through 2026-05-24. The week of 2026-05-18 ends on Sunday 2026-05-24. Opportunities have no region field, so I assigned each one to a market through its lead's region code.

