The CRM has 28,083 opportunities with stage "Closed Won" and a close date in 2026. Each opportunity ID appears once, so there are no duplicates.

Some of those close dates are after today (2026-11-17). Closed-won deals are dated in late November and December, and the data runs through 2026-12-28. I counted them anyway, since the house rules treat 2026 as a full year of data. If you only want deals closed to date, the number will be lower.

